                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style=";text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 24px"><span style="font-family:宋体">大课间跑操</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 24px"><span style="font-family:宋体">评价方案</span></span></strong></p><p style="line-height: 24px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">一、跑操场地：</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 24px"><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">高一</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">、</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">高二年级</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">：</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">田径场</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 24px"><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">高三年级：</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">篮球场</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 24px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">二、跑操</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">方案</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 24px"><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">跑操流程共分四个步骤即为集队</span><span style="font-family:Arial">→</span><span style="font-family:宋体">跑步</span><span style="font-family:Arial">→</span><span style="font-family:宋体">放松</span><span style="font-family:Arial">→</span><span style="font-family:宋体">退场，跑操期间各班学生须按照学校跑操方案中的要求认真执行。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 24px"><strong><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px">1</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:Arial">.</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">集队</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:Arial">1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">）</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">第二节下课铃响</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:Arial">9</span><span style="font-family:宋体">：</span><span style="font-family:Arial">10</span><span style="font-family:宋体">）</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">，</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">体育委员</span></span><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">穿好班服马甲</span></span></strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">组织</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">同学</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">迅速在走廊上整队，</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">成两路纵队</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">。</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">靠东侧的两个班级从东边楼梯下楼，靠西边的两个班级从西边楼梯下楼。</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">各班由体育委员带队，</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">两</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">路纵队，</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">慢跑</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">进入</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">指定</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">场地（</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">有序上下</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">楼梯），整个过程要求静、齐、快。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:Arial">2</span><span style="font-family:宋体">）</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">各班到达指定场地后，领跑员立即整理队形，</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">高一高二成</span><span style="font-family:Arial">8</span><span style="font-family:宋体">路纵队（除尾排之外每排须</span><span style="font-family:Arial">8</span><span style="font-family:宋体">人），高三成</span><span style="font-family:Arial">6</span><span style="font-family:宋体">路纵队（除尾之外每排须</span><span style="font-family:Arial">6</span><span style="font-family:宋体">人），</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">要求身穿</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">班服马甲的两位同学</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">站在队伍最前面。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:Arial">3</span><span style="font-family:宋体">）</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">全体</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">学生</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">都应参加跑操，因身体原因而不能参加长跑的学生应向班主任办理请假手续，大课间长期请假需</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">携带医院证明</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">提前到</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">德育处</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">办理手续，请假者必须在</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">规定时间到达</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">指定场地参加相应的</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">体育</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">活动</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 24px"><strong><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px">2</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:Arial">.</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">跑步</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:Arial">1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">）集合音乐倒计时十秒后，全校同时开始跑步</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:Arial">2</span><span style="font-family:宋体">）跑操中的“四度”——密度、力度、响度、速度。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">①</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">密度：班级与班级之之间保持</span><span style="font-family:Arial">5</span><span style="font-family:宋体">米左右的距离，迈小步（要求</span><span style="font-family:Arial">30</span><span style="font-family:宋体">厘米左右）、不停步，排面整齐，队形紧凑，不松散、不拖沓，摆臂时前不露肘，后不露手，即前后一臂距离，左右间隔大概</span><span style="font-family:Arial">20cm</span><span style="font-family:宋体">。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">②</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">力度</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">：要求抬头挺胸、精神饱满、整齐、有力，手臂小幅摆动有力到位。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">③</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">响度：跑操队伍行进过程中不允许打闹声、嬉笑声。踏地脚步声整齐且响亮，口号声气势磅礴、发自肺腑，整齐且响亮。（</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（口号由各班</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">自行</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">制定，要求：积极向上，</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">朗朗</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">上口</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">，</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">一跑一圈至少喊</span><span style="font-family:Arial">2</span><span style="font-family:宋体">次口号</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">）</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">④</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">速度：跑操时保持横竖排面整齐，整体匀速前进，不走路、不挤碰他人、不中途离队，跟随音乐的节拍行进，行进途中原则上不停顿，若前面没有行进空间，相应班级也务必原地跑步。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 24px"><strong><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px">3</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:Arial">.</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">放松</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:Arial">1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">）</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">在各班跑完规定的圈数后到跑操</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">相应的</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">集队位置，伴随放松音乐进行放松运动。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:Arial">2</span><span style="font-family:宋体">）</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">各班在放松时要基本上保持好队伍队形，不得喧哗。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 31px;line-height: 24px"><strong><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px">4</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:Arial">.</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">退场</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 24px"><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">体育老师进行总结反馈，宣布解散，学生方可有序退场，严禁提前离场。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 24px"><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">
</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 24px"><strong><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">考核评价</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">量化细则）</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 24px"><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">有以下行为的班级将扣除</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">或附加</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">相应班级</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">的跑操考核分并纳入</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">德育常规考核分，</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">在校网公布，</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">此项考核由</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">德育处、</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">体育</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">教师和值周班完成。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 24px"><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px">1</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:Arial">.</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">下楼后</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">领</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">队</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">同学没有</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">穿班服马甲，</span><span style="font-family:Arial">-1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">分</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 24px"><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px">2</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:Arial">.</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">出操过程中整齐规范且纪律良好两路纵队慢跑至指定场地，</span><span style="font-family:Arial">+</span><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:Arial">1~2</span><span style="font-family:宋体">）分，讲空话、喧闹、打闹、嬉笑、队伍凌乱，</span><span style="font-family:Arial">-</span><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:Arial">1~2</span><span style="font-family:宋体">）分。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:Arial">3.</span><span style="font-family:宋体">迟到</span><span style="font-family:Arial">-1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">分。（倒计时结束为标准）</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:Arial">4.</span><span style="font-family:宋体">跑操过程中班级整体动作一致、队伍整齐、力度饱满、速度恰当，相应</span><span style="font-family:Arial">+</span><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:Arial">1~3</span><span style="font-family:宋体">）分。领跑不规范，未和前面班级保持适当距离，队伍凌乱，有</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">讲话、</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">喧哗、</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">打闹、嬉笑、手放口袋</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">等现象</span><span style="font-family:Arial">-</span><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:Arial">1~3</span><span style="font-family:宋体">）分。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:Arial">5.</span><span style="font-family:宋体">跑操过程中每次在相应位置整齐且响亮喊出口号</span><span style="font-family:Arial">+1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">（高一、高二两个打分点分别在田径场主入口和主席台前；高三年级两个打分点分别在体育馆南侧台阶区域和图书馆北侧台阶区域。）</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:Arial">6.</span><span style="font-family:宋体">值日教师宣布解散后再退场，如提前退场</span><span style="font-family:Arial">-</span><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:Arial">1-2</span><span style="font-family:宋体">）分。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:Arial">7.</span><span style="font-family:宋体">故意不完成规定圈数的跑操每人次</span><span style="font-family:Arial">-1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">分。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:Arial">8.</span><span style="font-family:宋体">班级长期请假人数超过</span><span style="font-family:Arial">3</span><span style="font-family:宋体">人或当日临时请假人数超过</span><span style="font-family:Arial">3</span><span style="font-family:宋体">人，相应班级取消附加分资格</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:Arial">9</span><span style="font-family:宋体">请假同学不认真完成相应练习，提前退场</span><span style="font-family:Arial">-1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">分</span><span style="font-family:Arial">/</span><span style="font-family:宋体">人。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:Arial">10.</span><span style="font-family:宋体">体育教师将对出操人数进行抽查，若发现有同学逃避跑操则相应班级</span><span style="font-family:Arial">-1/</span><span style="font-family:宋体">人。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 24px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:Arial">11.</span><span style="font-family:宋体">细则如更改将以最新标准执行。</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 24px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">三、</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">优胜班级评比</span></span></strong></p><p style="line-height: 24px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"> </span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px">   <span style="font-family:宋体">按照评比细则评选出优秀班级，</span></span></strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">德育</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">处</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">每月</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">给予奖状，并纳入先进班级</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">量化</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">评比考核。</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 24px"><strong style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 19px"> </span></strong></p><p style=";text-align:center;line-height:28px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/12/202112061347223209.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202112061347223209.png" /></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 12px">                                                                                                                                  </span><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12px;"> </span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px;">德育</span><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 18px;"><span style="font-family:宋体">处</span>  </span><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 18px;"><span style="font-family:宋体">体育组</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 18px">                                                         </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 18px">            </span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 18px">  20</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 18px"><span style="font-family:Arial">21</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 18px"><span style="font-family:宋体">年</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 18px"><span style="font-family:Arial">1</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 18px"><span style="font-family:Arial">2</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 18px"><span style="font-family:宋体">月</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 18px"><span style="font-family:Arial">6</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 18px"><span style="font-family:宋体">日</span></span></p><p>
</p>
    
